# Coverage sweep for iomoon -- the rules sections the other captures leave out.
#
#   Little Multiball (rules 3.2.6).  The one Monolith position the walk never
#     cashes: LPA3 lights only while the ORBITS lights are on, and its award is
#     given at JUPITER, not at the scoop.  The sequence is one ball locked at
#     Jupiter with LPA3 lit, which lights LTB12 (LC17) at scoop 1; a ball is
#     served, and putting it into scoop 1 releases the Jupiter ball for two
#     balls in play.  The Monolith chases, so a lock has roughly one chance in
#     ten of landing on LPA3 -- hence six attempts of {lock, replacement,
#     scoop 1} rather than one.
#   All eleven lanes (rules 3.3.1), including lane 10 with ORBITS complete,
#     which pays 5,000,000 the first time instead of 2,000,000.
#   Bull's-eye 2 (rules 3.3.5), which the other walks never hit.
#   The inner bank target with the bank standing, which is its ordinary 50,001
#     rather than the Special Drop Probe path.
#   The end-of-ball bonus countdown, which needs a real drain.
#
# Needs a seeded NVRAM with credits -- see dmd/multiball/README.md.
